OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'beautiful soul'
OL,4,Akilled in multi-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, released through Police
OL,7,FScotland, Linda's family said she would
OL,8,Fbe "greatly missed" and "forever in
OL,9,Ftheir hearts".
